RESPONSE: Reflection: The bookmarks bar is now visible below the address bar (around y≈140). To create a new folder named “Favorites,” right-click an empty spot on the bar, select “Add folder…,” enter the name, and hit Enter.

```python
import pyautogui, time
time.sleep(0.5)
# 1) Right-click on the bookmarks bar (empty area)
pyautogui.click(500, 140, button='right')
time.sleep(0.5)
# 2) In the context menu, click “Add folder...” (approx. 40px down from the click point)
pyautogui.click(500, 180)
time.sleep(0.5)
# 3) Type the folder name and confirm
pyautogui.typewrite('Favorites')
time.sleep(0.2)
pyautogui.press('enter')
```
